{
    "title": "My Manpower App",
    "description": "Connecting you to your world of work has never been easier. My Manpower App offers convenient job search functions and job information at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nLooking for a Job:\r\n\u2022\tEffortless Job Search: Search a job database across industries, including Call Center & Customer Service, Creative & Marketing, Hospitality, Human Resources, Industrial & Manufacturing, Office & Administrative, and Warehousing. Filter by preferences and get matched with ideal jobs. \r\n\u2022\tStreamlined Applications: Apply for jobs with ease, track progress, and receive alerts \u2013 all in one place. \r\n\r\nFor Associates:\r\n\u2022\tReal-Time Access: View assignment details and access pay stubs anytime, anywhere. \r\n\u2022\tSimplified Management: Manage your profile, information, resume, and more, all within the user-friendly app.\r\n\r\nKey features of the My Manpower App:\r\n- Create your job search profile, login with your email address\r\n- Browse and apply for the latest job openings; filter results by hours, distance, location, etc. \r\n- Store and search for documents quickly\r\n- Delete documents from your account easily and securely\r\n- Get job alerts and recommendations\r\n- Access to payment information, employment documents and onboarding varies by country.\r\n\r\nAt Manpower, we know jobs. We have a proven track record of successfully connecting skilled talent with talent seekers for over 75 years. We understand the challenges that go hand in hand with the job hunt, and that\u2019s why we\u2019re committed to providing an enhanced user experience for associates and jobseekers alike. In the latest release, we\u2019ve extended job search functionality to more regions around the globe, helping to amplify your voice and discover your next job opportunity\u2014 we\u2019re here to help you every step of the way.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Connecting you to your world of work has never been easier. My Manpower App offers convenient job search functions and job information at your fingertips.<br><br>Looking for a Job:<br>\u2022\tEffortless Job Search: Search a job database across industries, including Call Center &amp; Customer Service, Creative &amp; Marketing, Hospitality, Human Resources, Industrial &amp; Manufacturing, Office &amp; Administrative, and Warehousing. Filter by preferences and get matched with ideal jobs. <br>\u2022\tStreamlined Applications: Apply for jobs with ease, track progress, and receive alerts \u2013 all in one place. <br><br>For Associates:<br>\u2022\tReal-Time Access: View assignment details and access pay stubs anytime, anywhere. <br>\u2022\tSimplified Management: Manage your profile, information, resume, and more, all within the user-friendly app.<br><br>Key features of the My Manpower App:<br>- Create your job search profile, login with your email address<br>- Browse and apply for the latest job openings; filter results by hours, distance, location, etc. <br>- Store and search for documents quickly<br>- Delete documents from your account easily and securely<br>- Get job alerts and recommendations<br>- Access to payment information, employment documents and onboarding varies by country.<br><br>At Manpower, we know jobs. We have a proven track record of successfully connecting skilled talent with talent seekers for over 75 years. We understand the challenges that go hand in hand with the job hunt, and that\u2019s why we\u2019re committed to providing an enhanced user experience for associates and jobseekers alike. In the latest release, we\u2019ve extended job search functionality to more regions around the globe, helping to amplify your voice and discover your next job opportunity\u2014 we\u2019re here to help you every step of the way.",
